# API Key Configuration for Smart Travel Planning Multi-Agent System

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your API keys:

```env
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
SERPAPI_API_KEY=your_serpapi_key_here
TAVILY_API_KEY=your_tavily_api_key_here
```

## Getting API Keys

### OpenAI API Key
1. Visit https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
2. Sign up or log in
3. Create a new API key
4. Copy and paste into `.env` as `OPENAI_API_KEY`

### SerpAPI Key
1. Visit https://serpapi.com/users/sign_in
2. Sign up for an account
3. Get your API key from the dashboard
4. Copy and paste into `.env` as `SERPAPI_API_KEY`

### Tavily API Key
1. Visit https://app.tavily.com/
2. Sign up for an account
3. Get your API key from the dashboard
4. Copy and paste into `.env` as `TAVILY_API_KEY`

## Note
- Never commit your `.env` file to version control
- The `.gitignore` should include `.env` to prevent accidental commits
